Z||000000||87PegasusGT||06-14-2000||01:38 PM||||97 40th Anniversary Special Edition Corvette Convertable.... With ZR-1 tips, gold wheels, and dual roll bars....Go figure. I had to race him though. I was surprised at how close it was. It actually took him 0-60 to put a car length on me. What the heck?!!! I think I will go look for a normal Vette to see where I really am in the performance world.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
